     46  ca8c ????	       00 2d	   LINK_MAX   equ	45	; bytes we let pile up in the Teensyboy (its buffer: 64)
     47  ca8c ????	       00 01	   NES_GAP    equ	1	; ms between messages to the MidiNES (wire-limited)
     48  ca8c ????	       01 5e	   DOUBLE_TAP equ	350	; ms: second RESTORE press within this = double tap
